<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>About Broadcom </B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Broadcom Inc. (NASDAQ: AVGO) is a
technology leader that designs, develops, and supplies semiconductors and infrastructure software for global organizations&#8217; complex, mission-critical needs. Broadcom combines long-term R&amp;D investment with superb execution to deliver the
best technology, at&nbsp;scale. Broadcom is a Delaware corporation headquartered in Palo Alto, CA. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Contact </B></P>
